00:59:34,647 --> 00:59:37,347
Welcome to YouTube Theater.

478
00:59:37,347 --> 00:59:39,577
Your safety is our number one priority.

479
00:59:39,827 --> 00:59:43,627
In the event that it becomes necessary
to evacuate YouTube Theater,

480
00:59:43,627 --> 00:59:48,047
please follow these guidelines to walk calmly
out and away from the facility.

481
00:59:48,047 --> 00:59:54,507
Those exiting the floor seats proceed
to the nearest safe stairwell on either side of the stage.

482
00:59:54,507 --> 00:59:59,327
Continue up the stairs until
you get to an exterior exit.

483
00:59:59,327 --> 01:00:02,352
Once outside, please continue
to walk away from the facility.

484
01:00:02,885 --> 01:00:07,165
Those seated in orchestra sections 101 through 105, walk up the aisles and out onto the concourse.

485
01:00:10,915 --> 01:00:17,065
Those in the box and club areas, exit out of your box or the club onto the concourse.

486
01:00:17,975 --> 01:00:23,885
Follow directions of YouTube staff who will be available to guide you to the nearest safe exit.

487
01:00:24,345 --> 01:00:31,035
If you're seated on the plaza level sections, walk up the aisles, turn left or right, and proceed out the door.

488
01:00:31,695 --> 01:00:43,065
Those on the balcony level, walk up the aisles onto the concourse, turn left or right, and continue down the nearest safe stairway to the ground level concourse and out the door.

489
01:00:43,615 --> 01:00:46,945
Once outside, please continue to walk away from the facility.

490
01:00:47,565 --> 01:00:50,895
Elevators will not be in service during an emergency evacuation.

491
01:00:52,055 --> 01:00:55,865
YouTube theater staff will be available to guide and assist you.

492
01:00:56,355 --> 01:01:02,835
For those who are unable to use stairs, YouTube theater staff will be available to assist you via an evacuation chair.

493
01:01:03,635 --> 01:01:06,845
This has been the evacuation plan for YouTube theater.

494
01:01:07,375 --> 01:01:12,175
Thank you for being prepared ahead of time to respond calmly in an emergency.

